1
00:00:08,636 --> 00:00:14,448
♪Myriad delusions cut like knives♪

2
00:00:14,448 --> 00:00:20,416
♪Crushing the moon in the ancient well♪

3
00:00:20,598 --> 00:00:25,536
♪Lost in this life,
I never ask about tomorrow♪

4
00:00:25,536 --> 00:00:31,216
♪When love runs deep,
the moonlight fades♪

5
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:39,851
♪A cursed fate,
a dream severed over lifetimes♪

6
00:00:40,662 --> 00:00:44,310
=Braving the Famine with My Wife=

7
00:00:44,599 --> 00:00:46,778
=Episode 17=

8
00:00:52,140 --> 00:00:55,380
Ancestor, why have you summoned me?

9
00:00:55,600 --> 00:00:56,780
Peerless True Immortal Lei Ting,

10
00:00:56,780 --> 00:00:59,439
the disciple of Divine Venerable
of Supreme Eternity,

11
00:00:59,479 --> 00:01:01,600
will soon arrive at our Zixia Sect.

12
00:01:02,020 --> 00:01:03,820
He's chosen our Holy Maiden
as his partner.

13
00:01:04,099 --> 00:01:05,340
Go bring her back.

14
00:01:07,040 --> 00:01:09,819
My daughter caught the eye
of the Peerless True Immortal?

15
00:01:10,640 --> 00:01:11,680
Then our Zixia Sect

16
00:01:12,459 --> 00:01:14,180
will surely shine for eternity!

17
00:01:15,959 --> 00:01:17,159
That's for sure.

18
00:01:27,819 --> 00:01:28,819
Father?

19
00:01:29,299 --> 00:01:30,719
What brings you here?

20
00:01:32,400 --> 00:01:33,400
Zhen,

21
00:01:33,400 --> 00:01:35,299
Peerless True Immortal
will arrive at our sect.

22
00:01:35,700 --> 00:01:36,859
He's chosen you as his partner.

23
00:01:37,099 --> 00:01:39,060
This is a supreme fortune for our sect.

24
00:01:39,260 --> 00:01:40,500
Come back with me at once.

25
00:01:41,480 --> 00:01:42,480
I'm not going back.

26
00:01:43,159 --> 00:01:45,780
That so-called True Immortal
might not even match my master.

27
00:01:46,000 --> 00:01:47,000
I'll serve my master.

28
00:01:47,000 --> 00:01:48,000
You...

29
00:01:50,859 --> 00:01:51,859
Your master?

30
00:01:51,859 --> 00:01:54,079
The owner of this rundown shack?

31
00:01:54,900 --> 00:01:56,900
Zhen, you're out of your mind.

32
00:01:57,120 --> 00:01:58,599
You're the Holy Maiden of Zixia Sect.

33
00:01:58,780 --> 00:01:59,780
With your noble status,

34
00:02:00,040 --> 00:02:02,640
how could you degrade yourself
to be someone's maid?

35
00:02:02,900 --> 00:02:04,200
And he's a True Immortal?

36
00:02:05,159 --> 00:02:06,879
This realm's spiritual energy is thin,

37
00:02:06,879 --> 00:02:07,980
and the laws are flawed.

38
00:02:07,980 --> 00:02:09,460
How could it hold a True Immortal?

39
00:02:09,900 --> 00:02:11,860
He must be a charlatan

40
00:02:12,120 --> 00:02:14,060
who tricked you with illusions.

41
00:02:14,199 --> 00:02:16,039
Father, you're wrong.

42
00:02:16,039 --> 00:02:18,060
My master's power
is far beyond your imagination.

43
00:02:18,060 --> 00:02:19,639
- He truly is...
- Enough!

44
00:02:19,639 --> 00:02:21,719
Stop this foolishness
and come with me right now.

45
00:02:21,719 --> 00:02:22,719
No.

46
00:02:22,719 --> 00:02:24,639
Father, watch closely.

47
00:02:24,639 --> 00:02:26,240
My master taught me this divine art.

48
00:02:30,020 --> 00:02:32,020
T-This is

49
00:02:32,340 --> 00:02:34,419
a divine art
that manipulates space itself.

50
00:02:35,319 --> 00:02:37,020
It's definitely not from our Zixia Sect.

51
00:02:37,240 --> 00:02:39,879
It doesn't even seem
to belong to this realm.

52
00:02:40,520 --> 00:02:41,520
Do you believe me now?

53
00:02:41,819 --> 00:02:44,219
An art my master taught casually
holds such power.

54
00:02:44,419 --> 00:02:45,939
His true depth is unfathomable.

55
00:02:46,080 --> 00:02:47,979
I saw him fish out
a true dragon yesterday.

56
00:02:47,979 --> 00:02:49,979
Silence. This art may be wondrous,

57
00:02:50,319 --> 00:02:53,979
but it only proves he stumbled
upon an ancient legacy.

58
00:02:54,180 --> 00:02:55,460
By some stroke of luck,

59
00:02:55,680 --> 00:02:58,199
he's learned a few lost divine arts
or secret techniques.

60
00:02:59,020 --> 00:03:02,960
He's a world apart
from a real Peerless True Immortal.

61
00:03:03,840 --> 00:03:06,080
The True Immortal who is descending

62
00:03:06,419 --> 00:03:08,159
has an aura that spans heaven and earth.

63
00:03:08,580 --> 00:03:10,659
He is a supreme being
from the upper realm.

64
00:03:11,620 --> 00:03:14,639
He's your destined partner.
Now come with me.

65
00:03:14,639 --> 00:03:15,639
No.

66
00:03:23,360 --> 00:03:24,759
(It's the seventh day.)

67
00:03:25,319 --> 00:03:26,719
(He still hasn't shown up.)

68
00:03:28,139 --> 00:03:29,139
(Then again,)

69
00:03:30,379 --> 00:03:32,039
(what was I hoping for?)

70
00:03:40,740 --> 00:03:41,740
Chu Yunxi,

71
00:03:42,500 --> 00:03:43,780
hand over the Imperial Seal,

72
00:03:44,360 --> 00:03:48,840
and I might spare your lives.

73
00:03:48,919 --> 00:03:50,919
Yunxi, don't listen to him.

74
00:03:51,180 --> 00:03:52,180
Hand over the seal or not,

75
00:03:52,479 --> 00:03:54,020
they will never let us live.

76
00:03:54,219 --> 00:03:55,219
I'm not afraid to die.

77
00:03:57,780 --> 00:03:58,780
Yunting,

78
00:03:59,879 --> 00:04:00,879
you've truly grown up.

79
00:04:06,780 --> 00:04:07,780
Chu Yunxi,

80
00:04:09,199 --> 00:04:10,659
hand over the Imperial Seal!

81
00:04:13,979 --> 00:04:15,120
You refuse, do you?

82
00:04:16,180 --> 00:04:18,620
Someone, chop off his arm!

83
00:04:18,620 --> 00:04:19,620
Yes!

84
00:04:19,800 --> 00:04:20,800
Stop!

85
00:04:31,759 --> 00:04:33,939
You idiot, what are you doing?

86
00:04:33,939 --> 00:04:36,420
My lord, I can't control myself.

87
00:04:37,560 --> 00:04:38,639
Playing tricks on me?

88
00:04:39,759 --> 00:04:41,620
Kill them all!

89
00:04:48,180 --> 00:04:49,519
Who's playing tricks here?

90
00:04:49,519 --> 00:04:50,680
Show yourself!

91
00:04:53,939 --> 00:04:56,079
I was hoping to enjoy
the show a bit longer,

92
00:04:56,600 --> 00:04:58,300
but as a villain,

93
00:04:59,000 --> 00:05:00,920
you can't even keep
your own men in line.

94
00:05:02,600 --> 00:05:03,600
Who are you?

95
00:05:04,899 --> 00:05:06,139
Who I am doesn't matter.

96
00:05:06,600 --> 00:05:10,300
What matters is, I'm here
to take my woman home.

97
00:05:13,500 --> 00:05:14,860
Arrogant fool!

98
00:05:15,399 --> 00:05:16,899
Tear him to pieces!

99
00:05:16,920 --> 00:05:17,920
Yes!

100
00:05:25,060 --> 00:05:26,660
Since you called me an ant,

101
00:05:27,680 --> 00:05:30,779
I'll let you taste
what it feels like to be one.

102
00:05:36,879 --> 00:05:37,879
Shrink.

103
00:05:38,220 --> 00:05:40,459
No. No.

104
00:05:40,459 --> 00:05:41,459
What...

105
00:06:02,879 --> 00:06:06,040
Well, I crushed an ant by accident.

106
00:06:12,416 --> 00:06:15,520
(Affection)

107
00:06:17,620 --> 00:06:18,699
Why are you staring?

108
00:06:19,360 --> 00:06:22,720
Charmed by my handsome looks again?

109
00:06:26,500 --> 00:06:28,060
Thank you for saving me.

110
00:06:34,819 --> 00:06:37,560
Is that all I get for saving you?

111
00:06:40,839 --> 00:06:42,980
You'll be well rewarded
when I return to the palace.

112
00:06:43,459 --> 00:06:45,639
A noble title or the premiership,
take your pick.

113
00:06:47,279 --> 00:06:50,939
I'm not interested in any of that.

114
00:06:51,440 --> 00:06:53,088
♪Her eyes still held a blade's edge♪

115
00:06:53,088 --> 00:06:55,490
♪Saying this world
isn't worth a single moment♪

116
00:06:55,879 --> 00:06:57,459
I'm only interested in you.

117
00:07:02,839 --> 00:07:05,560
Impudent! I am the ruler of a nation.

118
00:07:08,832 --> 00:07:12,077
♪So the Empress
can feel her heart turn cold♪

119
00:07:12,560 --> 00:07:15,280
♪You watched the sunset
in a narrow alley with her♪

120
00:07:15,280 --> 00:07:20,416
♪Hearing a child cry out in pain,
yet still laughing, so silly♪

121
00:07:20,839 --> 00:07:22,339
Not suitable for a child.

122
00:07:24,080 --> 00:07:27,824
♪So heaven can't compare
to a lamp in a broken hut♪

123
00:07:27,824 --> 00:07:29,792
♪From strangers to aching hearts♪

124
00:07:29,792 --> 00:07:31,728
♪From cold words to genuine care♪

125
00:07:31,728 --> 00:07:34,432
♪In the humblest corners
of the mortal world♪

126
00:07:34,432 --> 00:07:38,656
♪You met the most precious person♪

127
00:07:39,968 --> 00:07:41,936
♪She said commoners are just numbers♪

128
00:07:41,936 --> 00:07:44,512
♪You took her to see
the fields turned to scars♪

129
00:07:44,512 --> 00:07:46,176
♪And the old man bent by firewood♪

130
00:07:46,176 --> 00:07:48,592
♪A lifetime of bitterness
on his shoulders♪

131
00:07:48,592 --> 00:07:50,384
♪For the first time,
she set aside her crown♪

132
00:07:50,384 --> 00:07:54,944
♪And held an umbrella
for a drenched street vendor♪

133
00:07:54,944 --> 00:07:56,486
♪You can no longer ride the clouds♪

134
00:07:56,486 --> 00:07:58,396
♪But only toss and turn in the night♪

135
00:08:00,480 --> 00:08:02,839
Yunxi, my cultivation has improved...

136
00:08:04,220 --> 00:08:06,480
I don't want to endure
such pain anymore.

137
00:08:06,899 --> 00:08:08,300
Do you know what I mean?

138
00:08:10,980 --> 00:08:11,980
No, I don't.

139
00:08:15,879 --> 00:08:17,620
Haven't I been blunt enough?

140
00:08:19,379 --> 00:08:20,720
You're doing this on purpose.

141
00:08:21,920 --> 00:08:22,920
On purpose with what?

142
00:08:26,969 --> 00:08:28,288
♪Teasing, scolding, both fate♪

143
00:08:28,288 --> 00:08:29,904
♪So might cannot suppress♪

144
00:08:29,904 --> 00:08:32,364
♪The sincere wish
to let you soar freely♪

145
00:08:32,364 --> 00:08:33,744
♪So destiny cannot change♪

146
00:08:33,744 --> 00:08:36,064
♪A promise to walk
with you into the sunset♪

147
00:08:36,064 --> 00:08:38,000
♪From foes to friends♪

148
00:08:38,000 --> 00:08:39,728
♪From doubt to one heart♪

149
00:08:39,728 --> 00:08:41,728
♪In this harshest world♪

150
00:08:41,825 --> 00:08:44,360
♪You learn the gentlest endurance♪

151
00:08:44,360 --> 00:08:46,659
A gentleman never stays on the bottom.

152
00:08:48,879 --> 00:08:49,879
Cut the chatter.

153
00:08:51,120 --> 00:08:53,952
♪One side is immortality♪

154
00:08:53,952 --> 00:08:57,536
♪The other, a flame
snuffed out too soon♪

155
00:08:57,536 --> 00:08:59,440
♪Which side do you belong to?♪

156
00:08:59,440 --> 00:09:04,928
♪Eyes lock, and you both step forward♪

157
00:09:04,928 --> 00:09:08,678
♪So the Supreme Immortal
can fall to dust♪

158
00:09:08,678 --> 00:09:12,056
♪So the Empress can turn for someone♪

159
00:09:12,430 --> 00:09:14,704
♪No longer asking
who stands higher or mightier♪

160
00:09:14,704 --> 00:09:20,400
♪Only asking who stands
at your heart's door now♪

161
00:09:20,400 --> 00:09:23,904
♪If Heaven wants you to pass
through the street's rising smoke first♪

162
00:09:23,904 --> 00:09:25,504
♪If the mortal world cannot hold you♪

163
00:09:25,504 --> 00:09:27,904
♪Then carve the memories
into your palm lines♪

164
00:09:27,904 --> 00:09:29,712
♪From laughter to devotion♪

165
00:09:29,712 --> 00:09:31,632
♪From falling to innocence♪

166
00:09:31,632 --> 00:09:33,712
♪If there's a next life, you'll still♪

167
00:09:33,712 --> 00:09:40,379
♪Love a mortal once more
amidst this suffering♪

168
00:09:40,379 --> 00:09:41,820
(I am the Ancestor of Dao.)

169
00:09:42,679 --> 00:09:45,179
(Destiny, I have returned.)

170
00:09:47,320 --> 00:09:48,600
Golden Immortal stage.

171
00:09:50,179 --> 00:09:51,600
Dao Ancestor stage.

172
00:10:10,374 --> 00:10:13,965
♪With a clap of thunder,
you were cast into the mortal realm♪

173
00:10:13,965 --> 00:10:16,752
♪Silk robes replaced by rags♪

174
00:10:17,328 --> 00:10:19,490
♪Immortal bones buried in the dust♪

175
00:10:19,490 --> 00:10:22,336
♪One thought once stirred the seas♪

176
00:10:22,336 --> 00:10:25,614
♪Now, even cold porridge
is a lucky find♪

177
00:10:25,614 --> 00:10:27,248
♪She was cast out of the golden hall♪

178
00:10:27,248 --> 00:10:29,312
♪With only half a tattered decree♪

179
00:10:29,312 --> 00:10:30,848
♪Her eyes still held a blade's edge♪

180
00:10:30,848 --> 00:10:33,630
♪Saying this world
isn't worth a single moment♪

181
00:10:34,079 --> 00:10:35,984
♪You handed her a bowl of coarse tea♪

182
00:10:35,984 --> 00:10:42,015
♪Telling her to taste
life's bitter and sweet♪

183
00:10:42,597 --> 00:10:46,480
♪So the Supreme Immortal
can fall to dust♪

184
00:10:46,480 --> 00:10:49,705
♪So the Empress
can feel her heart turn cold♪

185
00:10:50,217 --> 00:10:52,816
♪You watched the sunset
in a narrow alley with her♪

186
00:10:52,816 --> 00:10:57,944
♪Hearing a child cry out in pain,
yet still laughing, so silly♪

187
00:10:57,944 --> 00:11:01,472
♪So power is no match
for a bowl of warm porridge♪

188
00:11:01,472 --> 00:11:05,180
♪So heaven can't compare
to a lamp in a broken hut♪

189
00:11:05,180 --> 00:11:07,072
♪From strangers to aching hearts♪

190
00:11:07,072 --> 00:11:09,149
♪From cold words to genuine care♪

191
00:11:09,149 --> 00:11:11,680
♪In the humblest corners
of the mortal world♪

192
00:11:11,680 --> 00:11:15,717
♪You met the most precious person♪

193
00:11:17,385 --> 00:11:19,248
♪She said commoners are just numbers♪

194
00:11:19,248 --> 00:11:21,767
♪You took her to see
the fields turned to scars♪

195
00:11:21,767 --> 00:11:23,216
♪And the old man bent by firewood♪

196
00:11:23,216 --> 00:11:25,518
♪A lifetime of bitterness
on his shoulders♪

197
00:11:25,518 --> 00:11:27,488
♪For the first time,
she set aside her crown♪

198
00:11:27,488 --> 00:11:31,898
♪And held an umbrella
for a drenched street vendor♪

199
00:11:31,898 --> 00:11:33,440
♪You can no longer ride the clouds♪

200
00:11:33,440 --> 00:11:35,350
♪But only toss and turn in the night♪

201
00:11:35,350 --> 00:11:38,624
♪Still kneeling at Heaven's Gate
in your dreams♪

202
00:11:38,624 --> 00:11:41,945
♪Only to wake up
with a flatbread she tossed at you♪

203
00:11:41,945 --> 00:11:43,680
♪Saying, forget the gods♪

204
00:11:43,680 --> 00:11:48,304
♪Just catch your breath first♪

205
00:11:48,304 --> 00:11:52,054
♪So the Supreme Immortal
can fall to dust♪

206
00:11:52,054 --> 00:11:55,432
♪So the Empress can turn for someone♪

207
00:11:55,806 --> 00:11:57,776
♪No longer asking
who stands higher or mightier♪

208
00:11:57,776 --> 00:12:03,523
♪Only asking who stands
at your heart's door now♪

209
00:12:03,523 --> 00:12:07,039
♪If Heaven wants you to pass
through the street's rising smoke first♪

210
00:12:07,039 --> 00:12:08,608
♪If the mortal world cannot hold you♪

211
00:12:08,608 --> 00:12:10,918
♪Then carve the memories
into your palm lines♪

212
00:12:10,918 --> 00:12:12,656
♪From laughter to devotion♪

213
00:12:12,656 --> 00:12:14,712
♪From falling to innocence♪

214
00:12:14,712 --> 00:12:16,560
♪If there's a next life, you'll still♪

215
00:12:16,560 --> 00:12:23,230
♪Love a mortal once more
amidst this suffering♪
